<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 7.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 7.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Mar 7	 Mar 6	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  269.350     269.750     247.020    9.04 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  305.490     305.500     306.830   -0.44 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.115     156.965     158.970   -1.17 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.598	46.546	47.182   -1.24 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  432.440     434.700     419.180    3.16 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.520     139.500     141.685   -1.53 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.853	15.792	16.185   -2.05 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  222.050     221.810     212.430    4.53 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.856	 1.888   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.566	 1.566	 1.581   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  182.105     181.275     183.135   -0.56%</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
